## Fix: Disable Privilege Escalation

Set allowPrivilegeEscalation to false in container security context:

```typescript
const pod = new k8s.core.v1.Pod("pod", {
    spec: {
        containers: [{
            name: "app",
            image: "nginx",
            securityContext: {
                allowPrivilegeEscalation: false,
                runAsNonRoot: true,
                capabilities: {
                    drop: ["ALL"],
                },
            },
        }],
    },
});
```

